# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of platform/local
# git config. This repo hit a Windows core.autocrlf=true issue where every
# checked-out file was flagged by `prettier --check` because CRLF was
# introduced on checkout while Prettier expects LF (Node/web tooling default).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — do not touch line endings
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
